ription":"Glycyl lysine isopeptide (Lys-Gly) (interchain with G-Cter in SUMO); in isoform Alpha"},{"type":"Cross-link","start":627,"end":627,"description":"Glycyl lysine isopeptide (Lys-Gly) (interchain with G-Cter in SUMO2)"}],"interfaces":{},"subunit":[{"topic":"Subunit","text":"Found in a complex with p53/TP53 and CABLES1. The C-terminal oligomerization domain binds to the ABL1 tyrosine kinase SH3 domain. Interacts with HECW2. Isoform Beta interacts homotypically and with p53/TP53, whereas isoform Alpha does not. Isoform Gamma interacts homotypically and with all p73 isoforms. Isoform Delta interacts with isoform Gamma, isoform Alpha, and homotypically. Isoforms Alpha and Beta interact with HIPK2. Isoform Alpha interacts with RANBP9. Isoform Beta interacts with WWOX. Interacts (via SAM domain) with FBXO45 (via B30.2/SPRY domain). Interacts with YAP1 (phosphorylated form). Interacts with HCK (via SH3 domain); this inhibits TP73 activity and degradation. Interacts (via SAM domain) with NQO1; this interaction is NADH-dependent, stabilizes TP73 in response to oxidative stress and protects it from ubiquitin-independent degradation by the 20S proteasome"},{"topic":"Subunit","text":"(Microbial infection) Interacts with Epstein-Barr virus protein EBNA6; this interaction inhibits TP73-mediated apoptotic pathway"}],"isoforms":[{"accession":"O15350-2","name":"Beta","synonyms":["p73beta"],"notes":[{"topic":"Miscellaneous","text":"Produced by alternative splicing of isoform Alpha"}],"length":499,"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000354437.8"],"refseq":["NM_001204184.2"],"refseqProteins":["NP_001191113.1"],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,1,494]],"edits":[{"start":495,"end":636,"original":"SFLTGLGCPNCIEYFTSQGLQSIYHLQNLTIEDLGALKIP","replacement":"RTWGP","added":5}],"missing":142,"replaced":0,"novel":5,"foldedAbsent":56,"foldedMissing":56,"features":[[12,57,0],[13,1,0],[14,1,0]],"interfaces":{},"model":{"entry":"AF-O15350-2-F1","cif":"https://alphaf